  {
   "post_number": 3,
   "username": "Tonga",
   "name": null,
   "created_at": "2020-12-18T09:35:03Z",
   "updated_at": "2020-12-18T09:35:03Z",
   "reply_to_post_number": null,
   "like_count": 0,
   "cooked": "<p>Is that the only possible use case? or extreme case? At the time of posting one of my main concerns was in regards to the ability of minting TEC tokens</p>",
   "action": null,
   "source": {
    "source": "commoncrawl",
    "timestamp": "20230530084419",
    "url": "https://forum.tecommons.org/t/dandelion-voting-app-and-its-capabilities-mostly-extreme-use-cases/170"
   }
  },
  {
   "post_number": 4,
   "username": "daithi",
   "name": null,
   "created_at": "2020-12-18T10:51:38Z",
   "updated_at": "2020-12-18T10:51:38Z",
   "reply_to_post_number": null,
   "like_count": 1,
   "cooked": "<p>normally I hate any central control, emotionally biased unfortunately <img alt=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/wink.png?v=9\" title=\":wink:\"/> , but I do like and promote aragon’s courts for communities. At least from what I’ve seen so far.</p>\n<p>Is it truley possible to use brightID (celeste) whilst staying anonymous? Through out the full pipeline, even at the brightID initial signup stage <img alt=\":thinking:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/thinking.png?v=9\" title=\":thinking:\"/> ?<br/>\n</p><aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\">\n<header class=\"source\">\n<img class=\"site-icon\" height=\"32\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/92828c7858211b02d0d926ab7420a83a29bb5e66.png\" width=\"32\"/>\n<a href=\"https://medium.com/brightid/anonymous-participation-e-g-voting-using-brightid-42a13b4d1c94\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"11:14PM - 27 June 2020\">Medium – 27 Jun 20</a>\n</header>\n<article class=\"onebox-body\">\n<div class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:690/388;\"><img class=\"thumbnail\" data-small-upload=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/90f4fae97cceff8df99f3421374c1c836158a2ee_2_10x10.png\" height=\"388\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/90f4fae97cceff8df99f3421374c1c836158a2ee_2_690x388.jpeg\" srcset=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/90f4fae97cceff8df99f3421374c1c836158a2ee_2_690x388.jpeg, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/90f4fae97cceff8df99f3421374c1c836158a2ee.jpeg 1.5x, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/90f4fae97cceff8df99f3421374c1c836158a2ee.jpeg 2x\" width=\"690\"/></div>\n<h3><a href=\"https://medium.com/brightid/anonymous-participation-e-g-voting-using-brightid-42a13b4d1c94\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\" target=\"_blank\">Anonymous Participation (e.g. voting) using BrightID</a></h3>\n<p>Overview</p>\n<p><span class=\"label1\">Reading time: 4 min read</span>\n</p>\n</article>\n<div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>",
