   "cooked": "<p>The most common painful scenario is voter apathy, and having too high of a quorum requirement… you can look at Tornado Cash right now…</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\">\n<header class=\"source\">\n<img class=\"site-icon\" height=\"128\" src=\"https://app.tornado.cash/favicon/favicon.ico\" width=\"128\"/>\n<a href=\"https://app.tornado.cash/governance/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">app.tornado.cash</a>\n</header>\n<article class=\"onebox-body\">\n<div class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:690/230;\"><img class=\"thumbnail\" data-small-upload=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/ab7e90b8000e830e3763ab545b57b9fbca9b13d9_2_10x10.png\" height=\"230\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/ab7e90b8000e830e3763ab545b57b9fbca9b13d9_2_690x230.png\" srcset=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/ab7e90b8000e830e3763ab545b57b9fbca9b13d9_2_690x230.png, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/ab7e90b8000e830e3763ab545b57b9fbca9b13d9_2_1035x345.png 1.5x, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/ab7e90b8000e830e3763ab545b57b9fbca9b13d9_2_1380x460.png 2x\" width=\"690\"/></div>\n<h3><a href=\"https://app.tornado.cash/governance/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Tornado.Cash</a></h3>\n<p>Non-custodial, trustless, serverless, private transactions on Ethereum network</p>\n</article>\n<div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n<p></p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" data-download-href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/c42e89344c59251cc74a2cb4f7ed77c197cb3eda\" href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/c42e89344c59251cc74a2cb4f7ed77c197cb3eda.png\" title=\"Screen Shot 2021-02-18 at 10.24.44 PM\"><img alt=\"Screen Shot 2021-02-18 at 10.24.44 PM\" data-base62-sha1=\"rZvhNlkuah5wVAsm4RdxpfzQ1yG\" data-small-upload=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/c42e89344c59251cc74a2cb4f7ed77c197cb3eda_2_10x10.png\" height=\"140\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/c42e89344c59251cc74a2cb4f7ed77c197cb3eda_2_690x140.png\" srcset=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/c42e89344c59251cc74a2cb4f7ed77c197cb3eda_2_690x140.png, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/c42e89344c59251cc74a2cb4f7ed77c197cb3eda_2_1035x210.png 1.5x, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/c42e89344c59251cc74a2cb4f7ed77c197cb3eda_2_1380x280.png 2x\" width=\"690\"/><div class=\"meta\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\"><use xlink:href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screen Shot 2021-02-18 at 10.24.44 PM</span><span class=\"informations\">2000×408 40.3 KB</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\"><use xlink:href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div>\n<p>They needed about 20k TORN to vote to lower the Quorum… but could only get 1/2 of that… We will see if they get there.</p>\n<p>Most of the worst case scenarios I can think of we are mitigating, as I am a loud voice making sure they get mitigated… i’m more curious about the worst case scenarios I don’t see…</p>",
